assume the information on page 25 is incorrect, and table on page 32 is correct.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks! That's about what I thought.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3776-autodefenestrate","name":"AutoDefenestrate","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3776_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"120"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-24T23:10:21-07:00","id":1096627,"title":"","content":"I've been thinking about adapting the myths of long tailed and two tailed cats as something like the &quot;Lich&quot; equivalent for them","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-03T08:18:06-07:00","id":1099828,"title":"","content":"Bouncing off the 'Machines' idea, I can easily see some sort of left-over non-sentient, non-sapient simple robots left over from the Age of Man. Something like Roomba springs to mind immediately to mind. Obviously it's a demon; going around with nothing like a head sucking up whatever is in it's path (yes, I'm playing off the stereotype of dogs/cats and vacuums). It could even be feasible that there's an automated factory somewhere still producing simple machines. In some cases, their shells could even be harvested for smeltable plastic. :^)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Currently Hosting <a href=\"http://opx-finalfrontier.wikidot.com\" target=\"_blank\">Outpost Phoenix</a>, an Non-Affiliated, Live-Action Star Trek <a href=\"https://discord.gg/6zwnyzm\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> Sim. New players are always welcome!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11235-arzie","name":"Arzie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11235_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"88"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-05T16:51:53-07:00","id":1100647,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arzie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/cavaliers-of-mars-and-pugmire/1094325-pugmire-thoughts-on-and-reactions-to-the-monarchies-of-mau-early-access?p=1099828#post1099828\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Bouncing off the 'Machines' idea, I can easily see some sort of left-over non-sentient, non-sapient simple robots left over from the Age of Man. Something like Roomba springs to mind immediately to mind. Obviously it's a demon; going around with nothing like a head sucking up whatever is in it's path (yes, I'm playing off the stereotype of dogs/cats and vacuums). It could even be feasible that there's an automated factory somewhere still producing simple machines. In some cases, their shells could even be harvested for smeltable plastic. :^)</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;He is like no cat.. he commands the forbidden arts of man.. the ancient R'umbah'&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian"